---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /reviews/
title: "Reviews | Gatorbacks Fishing Charters"
description: "Read Google reviews from anglers who fished Tampa Bay with Capt. William Ashmore of Gatorbacks Fishing Charters. See what to expect & book your trip."
hero: snook-smiling-angler.jpg
breadcrumb: Reviews
---
{% import "partials.njk" as ui %}
<section class="hero hero--short">
  {% heroImage hero, "Smiling angler holding a snook on the boat", "50% 22%" %}
  <div class="hero__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <div class="wrap hero__inner">
      <h1>Gatorbacks Fishing Charters Reviews</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2>What Anglers Say</h2>
      <p>Here's what people say after a day on the water with Capt. Ashmore, straight from his Google profile.</p>
    </div>
    {{ ui.reviewsWidget(site) }}
    <div class="cta-row cta-row--links">
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.googleReviewsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read all reviews on Google</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.googleLeaveReviewUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Leave a review</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ui.bookBand(site) }}
{{ ui.reviewsLoader() }}
